# Team-shared configuration for this PRIVATE repository.
#
# This file is committed on purpose so the few collaborators can clone and
# run without each provisioning their own key. It is safe ONLY while the repo
# stays private. If the repo is ever made public, rotate this key immediately
# (Google Cloud Console -> APIs & Services -> Credentials -> delete/recreate),
# because it will remain in git history.
#
# The key is restricted to the Fact Check Tools API, and its project has no
# billing attached, so the worst case from exposure is quota exhaustion.
#
# Per-user backend/.env overrides anything here.

